" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3189C0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2024584737/Module-Header-Brand-Extended-generic.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680" height="70" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F315600"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F318C20"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F317A70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F317CD0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3183D0"><td valign="top" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F317F30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F317220"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F317480"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F316790" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3169F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F316C50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F315F40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3161A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F313CD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F313F30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We recently tried to get in touch with you by phone, in relation to your existing Qantas Business Direct reports. With the closure of Qantas Business Direct earlier this year, these reports are now only available to our registered&nbsp;<b data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131BB7F0">Qantas Business Rewards members</b>.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F315840"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3143E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F312510"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F312770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As a Qantas Business Rewards member, not only would you have access to all of the great booking features previously available through Qantas Business Direct; but you would also be able to enjoy a number of enhanced tools and features, including:</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F311DF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F312050" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F310D50"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F310FB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3102A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F310500"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30D820" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30DA80" style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3153C0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30DCE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30DF40" style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ability to earn Qantas Points twice - once for your business<sup data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131B2A70" style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">1</sup>&nbsp;and once for the traveller<sup data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A4C30" style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">2</sup></font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30F480"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30F6E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30ED60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30EFC0" style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F315180" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30E400" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30E660" style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Access to exclusive savings<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3293E0" style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">3</sup>&nbsp;on eligible Qantas flights</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30D230"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C4010"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C4270" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2CB190" style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F315070" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2CB3F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30C060" style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Consolidated view of all company bookings</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F30C520"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2CB650"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2CB8B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C9660" style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F314E30" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C98C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2CA480" style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ability to add travellers instantly</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F328CC0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A6500"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F326A50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F326CB0" style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A9A50" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F329180" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F327FB0" style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ability to track your points and savings; as well as being able to make bookings using the Qantas App.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2CA940"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C9B20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3273D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A5A50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Membership of Qantas Business Rewards is available to you free of charge – saving you the standard $89.50 fee.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F327AF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F328470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A8290"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A57F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To learn more about how Qantas Business Rewards can benefit your business, or to sign up, have your ABN ready and click below.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131AA870"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131B2110" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C9D80"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C7B30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C7D90" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C8950"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C8BB0"><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C8E10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/why-join" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C7FF0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F314990" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C8250" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/why-join" target="_blank" alt="Level 3 Benefits" title="Level 3 Benefits" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C6000" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Let's get started</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C6260" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/why-join" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C6E20" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="Let's get started" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F314880" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C7080"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C72E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131AE5F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A7580" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C64C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C6720" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C44D0" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Want to speak in person?</font></h3></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F329640"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F328A60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you'd like to discuss these changes in more detail, please reply to this email and we'll be in touch shortly.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A69C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F32BAD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131A77E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131BF0D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Should you have any questions, or require more information:</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F32B170"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3246B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C4730"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F2C52F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid